<title>USA: Port Authority of ny/nj to sell $932 mln Friday.</title>
<headline>Port Authority of ny/nj to sell $932 mln Friday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Port Authority of New York and New Jersey plans to sell $932 million of revenue bonds on Friday through a negotiated sale, the offering's book runner, Lehman Brothers, said Thursday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
